import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 567 | Acceleration Domain | Sense-Origin Realm Adaptation — The Beginner Period's Acceleration Rhythm","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 567 | Acceleration Domain | Sense-Origin Realm Adaptation — The Beginner Period's Acceleration Rhythm","no":567,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Sense-Origin Realm","Realm Adaptation","Beginner Period","Time-Flow Rate"],"related":["502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","16-Multiplication Fruit Technicalization Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0567_模块3-加速域-感元境适配.md","filePath":"en/0567_模块3-加速域-感元境适配.md"}`),o={name:"en/0567_模块3-加速域-感元境适配.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-567-acceleration-domain-sense-origin-realm-adaptation-—-the-beginner-period-s-acceleration-rhythm" tabindex="-1">Entry 567 | Acceleration Domain | Sense-Origin Realm Adaptation — The Beginner Period&#39;s Acceleration Rhythm <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-567-acceleration-domain-sense-origin-realm-adaptation-—-the-beginner-period-s-acceleration-rhythm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 567 | Acceleration Domain | Sense-Origin Realm Adaptation — The Beginner Period&#39;s Acceleration Rhythm&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 16; Benchmark library: Entries 501, 502</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-which-flow-multiplier-suits-the-first-realm-is-a-craft" tabindex="-1">Introduction: which flow multiplier suits the first realm is a craft <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-which-flow-multiplier-suits-the-first-realm-is-a-craft" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: which flow multiplier suits the first realm is a craft&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s (Wanling Hengmao Origin Universe) dual-track time domain does not &quot;one-size-fits-all&quot; stuff all cultivators into a hundredfold flow. The Origin Acceleration Domain&#39;s time-flow gear must strictly match the cultivator&#39;s realm — this is the law-first axiom&#39;s direct manifestation in the time dimension. Sense-Origin, as the nine realms&#39; first realm, is the entry for all Myriad-Rank cultivators; its acceleration-rhythm design is especially sensitive: accelerate too fiercely, it hollows out the beginner&#39;s true bodily feeling of &quot;energy entering the body for the first time&quot;; accelerate insufficiently, it wastes the mature efficiency dividend of Multiplication Fruit Technicalization (Document 16).</p><p>Six top-level axioms jointly gate here: anti-predation axiom requires Sense-Origin acceleration come from law-efficiency improvement, not devouring others&#39; time; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires this beginner acceleration rhythm open to 99% of Myriad Ranks, no noble children monopolizing the fast lane; collective ascension axiom requires beginner-period acceleration output ultimately feed back the whole cultivation community; causal self-discipline axiom requires beginners&#39; acceleration operations recorded throughout by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, preventing newcomers&#39; misoperation from perturbing causality; law-first axiom writes &quot;Sense-Origin adapted flow&quot; as a law clause that may not be arbitrarily reset, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry answers a concrete question: a cultivator who has just sensed wandering energy, in the Origin Acceleration Domain, at what rhythm should he begin his first class.</p><h2 id="i-why-sense-origin-cannot-directly-take-hundredfold-flow" tabindex="-1">I. Why Sense-Origin Cannot Directly Take Hundredfold Flow <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-sense-origin-cannot-directly-take-hundredfold-flow" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Sense-Origin Cannot Directly Take Hundredfold Flow&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Sense-Origin&#39;s core tasks are &quot;perception awakening, basic absorption, energy discernment, foundation-condensation&quot; (Document 14). These four highly depend on <strong>true resonance between body and consciousness</strong>: first sensing spiritual qi, first guiding energy into the body, first discerning law aura; these experiences constitute the cultivator&#39;s lifelong &quot;origin memory.&quot; If directly applying default hundredfold flow, three systemic faults appear:</p><ol><li><strong>Perception dulling</strong>: consciousness under hundredfold flow forcibly stretched; the beginner instead cannot distinguish energy from hallucination in &quot;normal time sense,&quot; mistaking consciousness noise for law aura.</li><li><strong>Body cannot keep up</strong>: if energy-absorption rate is pulled to the limit by consciousness acceleration, the flesh (especially carbon-based life) cannot synchronously infiltrate, appearing as a tearing feeling of &quot;consciousness ran ahead, body still in place.&quot;</li><li><strong>Origin-memory hollowing</strong>: the beginner period spent under hundredfold flow, in retrospect like a fast-forwarded dream, lacking the weight of &quot;first times&quot; that constitute personality thickness. This directly conflicts with the core thesis &quot;acceleration ≠ hollow.&quot;</li></ol><p>Thus the Origin Acceleration Domain specially designs a <strong>Beginner Gear</strong> for Sense-Origin: 5× to 10× flow, with the first three days mandatorily at 1× real flow to complete &quot;zero-point anchoring.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-beginner-gear-s-four-stage-rhythm" tabindex="-1">II. Beginner Gear&#39;s Four-Stage Rhythm <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-beginner-gear-s-four-stage-rhythm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Beginner Gear&#39;s Four-Stage Rhythm&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Duration (Real)</th><th>In-Domain Flow</th><th>Core Task</th><th>Exit Detection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Zero-Point Anchoring</td><td>3 days</td><td>1×</td><td>Establish energy-perception baseline under normal time sense</td><td>Perception stability ≥ 60%</td></tr><tr><td>Gentle Acceleration</td><td>7 days</td><td>5×</td><td>Repeat basic absorption at 5× flow</td><td>Energy atlas初步成形</td></tr><tr><td>Gear Probing</td><td>14 days</td><td>10×</td><td>Probe self tolerance ceiling</td><td>No body-tearing reports</td></tr><tr><td>Consolidation Transition</td><td>Long-term</td><td>5–10×</td><td>Maintain Sense-Origin daily cultivation rhythm</td><td>May apply to enter Condensed-Origin acceleration gear</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This rhythm&#39;s essence is &quot;slow first, then fast; from slow into fast.&quot; It is not punishment, but <strong>experience-preservation engineering</strong>: let the beginner complete the first time in true time sense, then let law acceleration take over the repetitive labor afterward. Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision real-time monitors each beginner&#39;s &quot;time-sense anchoring index&quot;; once the index falls below threshold, automatically slow to 1× until restabilized.</p><h2 id="iii-myriad-rank-differentiated-beginner-rhythms" tabindex="-1">III. Myriad-Rank Differentiated Beginner Rhythms <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-myriad-rank-differentiated-beginner-rhythms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Myriad-Rank Differentiated Beginner Rhythms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The republican axiom of Myriad Races requires this rhythm serve not just the human race. The five gene lineages (carbon-based matter, energy-condensation, mechanical-construction, consciousness-information, mixed-variant) have vastly different beginner tolerance:</p><ul><li><strong>Carbon-Based Matter Race</strong> (human, beast, etc.): the flesh is the bottleneck; Beginner Gear takes the 5× ceiling, emphasizing flesh infiltration.</li><li><strong>Energy-Condensation Race</strong>: no flesh, consciousness sensitive; Beginner Gear takes 3×, preventing consciousness overshoot.</li><li><strong>Mechanical-Construction Race</strong>: hardware iteration fast, may bear 20×, but needs additional &quot;emotion-module calibration.&quot;</li><li><strong>Consciousness-Information Race</strong>: most dangerous, consciousness flow itself extremely fast; Beginner Gear instead must drop to 0.5× (i.e., enter the Quest Domain slow segment) to avoid self-wrapping.</li><li><strong>Mixed-Variant Race</strong>: case-by-case verified by the Anchor Council, usually in the 5–10× range.</li></ul><p>Plant spirits, planet consciousness and other strange life (Document 53) entirely do not follow the human rhythm; their &quot;beginner&quot; is measured in geological eras; the Origin Acceleration Domain opens a separate ten-thousand-year gear for them, preventing any Myriad-Rank lineage from being excluded from the acceleration dividend due to different time scales.</p><h2 id="iv-fundamental-opposition-to-the-predatory-faction-s-beginner-methods" tabindex="-1">IV. Fundamental Opposition to the Predatory Faction&#39;s Beginner Methods <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-fundamental-opposition-to-the-predatory-faction-s-beginner-methods" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Fundamental Opposition to the Predatory Faction&#39;s Beginner Methods&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the old predatory-faction system, &quot;beginner acceleration&quot; meant two things: one was entering a grand sect by resource stacking (bounty-style); the other was devouring low-tier beings&#39; energy for quick success (predatory-style). The former turned beginner qualification into a class ticket; the latter built the beginner on others&#39; sacrifice. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Sense-Origin acceleration gear seals both paths:</p><ul><li>Beginner-Gear resources distributed by the joint-contracting mechanism (Document 22), more work more gain, no look at origin;</li><li>Beginner&#39;s energy comes from environmental incremental development and law cycle, traceable on Alaya, no one else&#39;s energy residue;</li><li>Every beginner-period acceleration is recorded, becoming raw data for future civilizational-weight evaluation.</li></ul><p>This is precisely anti-predation axiom&#39;s manifestation at the microcosm: <strong>a person&#39;s first step to getting stronger must not be another&#39;s first step to getting weaker.</strong></p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: do not waste hundredfold flow on the beginner period most needing slow experience; use 5–10× gear to precisely match perception tasks, avoiding law-network load overload</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: beginner acceleration all from law-efficiency improvement and incremental resources, zero devouring, zero bounty, Alaya-traceable</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style beginner is locked by sect resources and bloodline talent; mortals do not even have qualification to enter acceleration; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Beginner Gear opens to 99% of Myriad Ranks, gear assigned by individual tolerance not origin</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages and strange life each have dedicated Beginner Gear; consciousness-information race even reverse-slows, ensuring no lineage marginalized by time-scale difference</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Beginner-Gear parameters, monitoring algorithms, anchoring-index formula all public; anyone may recompute, audit; this is the first link in the open chain from basic techniques to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Sense-Origin acceleration rhythm is the whole dual-track time domain&#39;s first practice on the &quot;fast and slow&quot; philosophy. It tells every being just stepping onto the cultivation road: you deserve to be accelerated, but you also deserve to be treated slowly and seriously. Not chasing speed in the beginner period is precisely so that future speed has a non-hollow root.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./502_模块3-本源加速域-时间流速调控原理.html">502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">16-Multiplication Fruit Technicalization Principle</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
